{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q161547","formula":"C₈H₁₂","hill":"C8H12","elements":["H","C"],"composition":{"C":8.0,"H":12.0},"names":{"en":"(1Z,5Z)-1,5-cyclooctadiene","ru":"1,5-Циклооктадиен"},"descriptions":{"en":"1,5-Cyclooctadiene (also known as cycloocta-1,5-diene) is a cyclic hydrocarbon (a cycloalkene) with the chemical formula C8H12, specifically [−(CH2)2−CH=CH−]2. There are three configurational isomers with this structure, that differ by the arrangement of the four C–C single bonds adjacent to the double bonds. Each pair of single bonds can be on the same side (cis,Z) or on opposite sides (trans,E) of the double bond's plane; the three possibilities are denoted cis,cis, trans,trans, and cis,trans; or (Z,Z), (E,E), and (Z,E).","ru":"1,5-Циклооктадиен (обычно сокращённо COD) — представляет собой непредельный углеводород с общей формулой C8H12, содержащий в своей структуре восьмичленный углеродный цикл с двумя несопряженными двойными связями. Является диеном циклического строения. Бесцветная жидкость с резким запахом, малорастворимая в воде."},"fame":20,"pubchemCid":82916,"mass":108.18,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1/C=C\\CC/C=C\\C1","inchikey":"VYXHVRARDIDEHS-QGTKBVGQSA-N","iupac":"(1Z,5Z)-cycloocta-1,5-diene","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"82916","atoms":20,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-1.757,"y":0.719,"z":-0.003,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.58,"y":1.429,"z":-0.674,"el":"C"},{"x":0.58,"y":-1.429,"z":-0.674,"el":"C"},{"x":1.757,"y":-0.719,"z":-0.003,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.589,"y":-0.702,"z":0.462,"el":"C"},{"x":0.615,"y":1.59,"z":0.216,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.615,"y":-1.59,"z":0.216,"el":"C"},{"x":1.589,"y":0.702,"z":0.462,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.612,"y":0.743,"z":-0.69,"el":"H"},{"x":-2.057,"y":1.312,"z":0.872,"el":"H"},{"x":-0.913,"y":2.438,"z":-0.954,"el":"H"},{"x":-0.3